{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 22, :comments ["<b>Upon the women.</b> With the women and adjacent to them." "<b>Chach.</b> It is a round golden ornament placed on the arm — and it is the צָּמִיד." "<b>And the kumaz.</b> It is a golden ornament placed opposite that place on a woman, and our Sages explained the word כּוּמָז: כָּאן מְקוֹם זִמָּה (Shabbat 64a)."], :book :exodus, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 35, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T08:56:44.731208946Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}